cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this index or dataset, please cite the companion paper below."
title: "A Fertilizer Shortage (FS) Index"
abstract: >-
  A search-based Fertilizer Shortage (FS) index measuring reported disruptions to
  global fertilizer supply. Building on Baker, Bloom, and Davis (2016), the index
  tracks the frequency of news articles jointly referencing the fertilizer
  industry and supply-shortage language, from January 1977 onward.
type: dataset
